      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "<b>Dr_Brown</b>,<br />\nЯ не просто так процитировал <a href=\"http://torrentpier.com/threads/%D0%A2%D0%B0%D0%B9%D1%82%D0%BB-%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F-%D0%BA%D0%BB%D1%8E%D1%87%D0%B8-%D0%B8-%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%B0-%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B2.25093/#post-57171\" class=\"link link--internal\">#10</a> твой пост. ))",
